      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a must have, hell, even ROBLOX allows you to make requests to whatever dynamic URLs you please, as long as it's requested from the server, and even then you can just use their RemoteFunctions/RemoteEvents to pipe the response data back to the client. If ROBLOX can do it, VRChat clearly can.",
